[background arg="res://assets/Scene_Overlay.png" fade="0.2"]
join Lizzy (Talking) right [animation="Fade In Up"]
join Juniper (Talking) leftmost [animation="Fade In Up"]
join Barb (Talking) left [animation="Fade In Up" wait="true" extra_data="show Normal"]
Juniper: Hey, Lizzy, want to head to the exam together?
Lizzy: ... why isn’t there zombies everywhere eating people?
Juniper: Should there be?
Lizzy: Uh. Yeah.
Lizzy: Also wait, exam? We already did an exam and it was terrible
Barb: Graduation’s tomorrow...?
Juniper: Are you feeling alright?
Lizzy: ...
Lizzy: So you guys haven't noticed anything strange around here recently?
Lizzy: Like dead people shambling around.
Barb: It concerns me how genuinely you asked that.
Lizzy: Just keep your eyes peeled.
